### Efficiency and Acceptance

For the di-electron continuum, the raw yield of di-electron signal has to be corrected for the efficiency within the STAR acceptance of \(|y_{e^{+}e^{-}}|\!<\!1\), \(|\eta_{e}|\!<\!1\) and \(p_{T}(e)\!>\!0.2\). The pair detection efficiency within STAR acceptance was calculated by single electron efficiency from TPC+TOF. The single electron efficiency includes the TPC tracking efficiency, TOF

